/* Fan control (helper, manual mode, Smart Boost) */
"fan.warning.main" = "Using fans manually can increase noise and power use, and it replaces macOS's own judgement while active. macOS keeps its thermal protection and can still throttle the chip. Manual control is off by default and always returns to automatic when you quit the app, put the Mac to sleep, or something fails.";
"fan.warning.untested" = "This feature was written without being able to test it on every chip. Until you run \"Test control\" on this Mac it is treated as experimental. Use at your own risk.";
