"fan.helper.note" = "The helper is a small background service that runs as administrator and is the only part that writes to the fan controller. It only accepts connections from your own macOS user, only changes fan targets inside each fan's real minimum and maximum, and returns to automatic if the app stops talking to it for 10 seconds.";
